# REQUIREMENTS: cu-003
# TIMESTAMP: 2026-10-09

The writer emits one subdirectory per regular CU holding its four component
files and NO flat per-CU frame for component-carrying CUs (component-less
legacy CUs keep flat frames); keeps ARCH.itr/LEGEND.itr and other globals
at the ITR root; writes root SYNOPSIS.itr (features, MAX_ATTEMPTS,
implementation summary); keeps IMPLEMENTATION_STEPS.itr gitignored.
